WEBVTT

00:03:59.363 --> 00:04:01.486
Je uzoefu wako umejidhihirisha wenyewe

00:04:01.486 --> 00:04:03.537
kuwa wa kuaminika?

00:04:03.537 --> 00:04:06.404
Kama tunavyohukumu shuhuda za wengine

00:04:06.404 --> 00:04:07.991
kwa rekodi zao,

00:04:07.991 --> 00:04:10.325
pia tunaweza kuhukumu maarifa yetu

00:04:10.325 --> 00:04:12.019
kwa rekodi zao.

00:04:12.019 --> 00:04:14.332
Na hii inatupeleka hatua moja karibu

00:04:14.332 --> 00:04:16.534
katika uono wa majukumu yetu

00:04:16.534 --> 00:04:19.604
na uhusiano wetu na dunia inayotuzunguka.